cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this evidence package, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "AcaTime production validation evidence"
abstract: >-
  Aggregate, privacy-preserving evidence and sanitized logs for 17 faculty-scale
  AcaTime GA validation runs: scores, improvement percentages, durations and
  checksums. Raw institutional data and schedules are not included.
type: dataset
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-13
